# 🕵️ DuneRealm — Mystery System

## 🎯 Purpose

DuneRealm ki identity uski long-form mystery aur investigation system se bani rahegi.

Mystery ka main purpose player ko explore, investigate aur clues connect karne ke liye encourage karna hai.

---

# 🧩 Core Mystery Structure

DuneRealm ki mystery do major phases me divided hogi:

1. 🏺 Past Investigation
2. 🏜️ Present-Day Investigation

Past player ko important clues dega.

Present-day investigation un clues ko connect karne ka main phase hoga.

---

# 🏺 Past Investigation

Player accident ke baad ancient civilization ke time me pahunchta hai.

Past experience:

- One-time hoga
- Repeat nahi kiya ja sakega
- Major story clues provide karega
- Ancient civilizations ko reveal karega
- Ancient people aur workers ko dikhayega
- Pyramid construction aur ancient life ko explore karwayega
- Hidden information provide karega

Player ko initially ye samajh nahi aayega ki woh past me pahunch chuka hai.

---

# ⏳ One-Time Past System

Past me player ki entry ek special story event hogi.

Player ek baar past experience complete karega.

Uske baad woh normal gameplay ke through past me dobara nahi ja sakega.

Isliye player ko past experience ke dauran important clues aur information carefully observe karni hogi.

---

# 🔎 Present-Day Investigation

Past experience complete hone ke baad main mystery present-day DuneRealm me continue hogi.

Player:

- Ancient symbols search karega
- Ruins investigate karega
- Hidden locations discover karega
- Old records find karega
- Strange objects investigate karega
- NPCs se information lega
- Previous clues ko compare karega
- Different locations ke clues connect karega

---

# 🧠 Clue Connection System

DuneRealm me clues individually complete answer nahi denge.

Player ko multiple clues ko connect karna padega.

Example:

Ancient symbol
+
Old record
+
Present-day location
+
Past experience ki memory

↓

New discovery

Is system ka purpose player ko khud conclusion tak pahunchana hai.

---

# 🕵️ Hidden Mystery

DuneRealm ki main mystery openly announce nahi ki jayegi.

Player ko gradually discover karna padega:

- Ancient civilizations ka connection
- Hidden locations
- Unknown characters
- Ancient events
- Unexplained structures
- Past aur present ke connections

Kuch information sirf specific investigation ke baad available hogi.

---

# 🌍 Multiple Ancient Civilizations

DuneRealm me ek hi ancient civilization nahi hogi.

Multiple ancient civilizations ke traces aur stories exist kar sakte hain.

Player ko gradually pata chalega ki desert ke andar alag-alag civilizations ke traces maujood hain.

Ye discovery gradually reveal hogi.

---

# 🧭 Mystery Depth

DuneRealm ke outer areas comparatively modern aur recognizable honge.

Jaise-jaise player desert ke andar jayega:

- Civilization older hoti jayegi
- Structures stranger hote jayenge
- Mysteries deeper hoti jayengi
- Ancient clues milte jayenge
- Unexplained events increase ho sakte hain

Player ko immediately nahi bataya jayega ki andar kya hai.

---

# 👤 Unknown Characters

Kuch characters ki actual identity immediately reveal nahi hogi.

Player ko:

- Unse baat karni
- Unko observe karna
- Unke behaviour ko samajhna
- Unke clues connect karna

pad sakta hai.

Kuch characters helpful ho sakte hain.

Kuch suspicious ho sakte hain.

Kuch ki actual importance baad me samajh aa sakti hai.

---

# 🌪️ Ancient Powers & Strange Events

DuneRealm ke deeper ancient areas me kuch extremely old civilizations aur unusual groups ho sakte hain.

Kuch characters ya groups:

- Weather ko influence karne ki koshish kar sakte hain
- Storms create karne se related rituals kar sakte hain
- Ancient practices follow kar sakte hain
- Strange abilities ka use kar sakte hain

In elements ko mystery ke part ke roop me gradually reveal kiya jayega.

---

# 🎭 Mystery + Other Genres

Mystery DuneRealm ka main foundation hai.

Lekin investigation ke beech situation ke according:

- 👻 Horror
- 😂 Comedy
- ⚔️ Action
- 🏜️ Adventure

appear ho sakte hain.

Har scene ko same tone me nahi rakha jayega.

---

# 👥 Multiplayer Mystery

DuneRealm mystery solo bhi complete ki ja sakti hai.

Team ke saath players:

- Clues discuss kar sakte hain
- Different locations investigate kar sakte hain
- Information share kar sakte hain
- Different discoveries ko connect kar sakte hain
- Investigation ko faster complete kar sakte hain

Team mystery ka separate version nahi banayegi.

Sab players same shared mystery experience ka part honge.

---

# 🤖 NPC Investigation

NPC team members bhi investigation me help kar sakte hain.

NPC:

- Information provide kar sakte hain
- Locations suggest kar sakte hain
- Clues notice kar sakte hain
- Investigation me assistance de sakte hain

Lekin final mystery ko automatically NPC solve nahi karenge.

Player ko khud investigation me participate karna hoga.

---

# 🔐 Mystery Difficulty

Mystery intentionally long-form hogi.

Player ko:

- Immediate answers nahi milenge
- Har clue ka meaning turant nahi samajh aayega
- Multiple locations visit karni padengi
- Previous discoveries yaad rakhni padengi
- Different information ko connect karna padega

Mystery ko gradually reveal kiya jayega.

---

# 🏁 Mystery Completion

Mystery ka final answer player ke collected clues aur discoveries se connect hoga.

Final stage par player ko samajh aayega ki:

- Past me kya dekha tha
- Present me uska connection kya tha
- Ancient civilizations ka role kya tha
- Hidden clues ka meaning kya tha
- Mystery ka actual truth kya tha

---

# 🏆 Mystery Reward

Mystery complete karne par player ko gameplay-advancing power directly dena zaroori nahi hai.

Possible rewards:

- 🏷️ Special Title
- ⭐ Achievement
- 📜 Story Recognition
- 🏆 Completion Record

Special rewards future system decisions ke according expand kiye ja sakte hain.

---

# 🔒 Important Rules

- Mystery openly reveal nahi hogi.
- Past experience one-time hoga.
- Past important clues provide karega.
- Present-day investigation main mystery phase hoga.
- Multiple ancient civilizations possible hain.
- Mystery gradually deeper hoti jayegi.
- Unknown characters ki identities immediately reveal nahi hongi.
- Solo mystery completion possible hogi.
- Team mystery completion possible hogi.
- NPCs investigation me help kar sakte hain.
- NPCs automatically final mystery solve nahi karenge.
- Comedy, horror aur action mystery ke beech naturally use honge.
- Final truth player ko clues connect karke discover karna hoga.

---

# ⭐ Core Principle

**The Past Reveals.**

**The Present Connects.**

**The Player Discovers.**

DuneRealm ki mystery ka main goal ye hai ki player ko final answer sirf bataya na jaye.

Usse khud feel ho:

**"Maine ye mystery solve ki hai."**